---
source: tests/keys.rs
expression: app.backend()
---
" [1] My Issues │ [2] Team Issues │ [3] Analytics                                "
"┌My Issues · group: workflow state · sort: active cycle, then priority─────────┐"
"│┌ Keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │"
"││ Move                                │ Edit the issue                      │ │"
"││  j/k      down / up                 │  s  workflow state                  │ │"
"││  gg/G     top / bottom              │  a  assignee                        │ │"
"││  C-d/C-u  half page                 │  p  priority                        │ │"
"││  h/l      pane left / right         │  L  labels                          │ │"
"││  Esc      close or step back        │  e  estimate                        │ │"
"││                                     │  E  title and description           │ │"
"││ Open & copy                         │  c  comment                         │ │"
"││  Enter  open the issue              │  n  new issue                       │ │"
"││  yi/yu  copy key / URL              │                                     │ │"
"││  yb/ym  copy branch / link          │ App                                 │ │"
"││  o      Linear page or PR           │  1/2/3  screens   r      refresh    │ │"
"││  O      other links                 │  ?      keys      :,C-k  palette    │ │"
"││                                     │  /      search    q      quit       │ │"
"││ Issue list                          │  C-z    suspend                     │ │"
"││  vg/vs  group / sort                │                                     │ │"
"│└ Esc close ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" Move │ j/k move                                                                "
" Do   │ Enter pick │ Tab toggle │ Esc close                                     "
"                                                                                "
